  "summary": "Package fetches and executes remote JavaScript from a mutable Bitbucket URL",
  "details": "index.html/index.js fetch HTML from a hardcoded raw Bitbucket URL on the mutable `main` branch, parse it with DOMParser, and recreate every <script> node (both src-referenced and inline textContent) into the current document so they execute in the loading context. The remote content is unpinned and controlled by a third-party Bitbucket account, so whoever controls that repository can substitute arbitrary JavaScript at any time and have it run wherever this package is loaded.",
